  "guidance_candidates": [
    {
      "text": "Within a button, a label generally conveys what the button does, such as Edit, Cancel, or Send",
      "section_path": [
        "Labels"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "c09ea2e38750200a44d84898b0659ab21dffb370436c983c9476f4c28875c86f",
      "word_count": 17
    },
    {
      "text": "Within many lists, a label can describe each item, often accompanied by a symbol or an image",
      "section_path": [
        "Labels"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "99019b9965fba168c1ac2c0cb1aec57b6d56462b48337933679db97d9bba4e52",
      "word_count": 17
    },
    {
      "text": "Within a view, a label might provide additional context by introducing a control or describing a common action or",
      "section_path": [
        "Labels"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "24855034f9d05c2f92e84380f303cbe19e4aee22f6cc5e1edf430e959bf2e9d4",
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "Use a label to display a small amount of text that people don’t need to edit",
      "section_path": [
        "Labels",
        "Best practices"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "a242b1bfe55ebf8eed12c05789c4e3978618f8436a73102d8d76b2046468e6ce",
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "If you need to let people edit a small amount of text, use a text field",
      "section_path": [
        "Labels",
        "Best practices"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "7fe92bc710206e1a565d698d6b9bb182a712eb907ab9a90c2109de844943d1c2",
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "Use a text view for large amounts of text that may be editable",
      "section_path": [
        "Labels",
        "Best practices"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "61d1ab2663a03f40356cf7e1e70629cdfd7a3f3c660931595c01a0a679ea9b15",
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "Prefer system fonts",
      "section_path": [
        "Labels",
        "Best practices"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "1fdf4f005d94d0ba4b080f555552101321f752819d89566127fe6cd8d531a89a",
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "If you adjust the style of a label or use custom fonts, make sure the text remains legible",
      "section_path": [
        "Labels",
        "Best practices"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "780fe51f6c9a01ae509fdf0d32ae0f965f6388faa282d7b15cc931d4661ef8d2",
      "word_count": 18
    },
    {
      "text": "Use system-provided label colors to communicate relative importance",
      "section_path": [
        "Labels",
        "Best practices"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "eaa9563cefd11b5d2588ad797a0e843f5960bc53d45e6ffefa92df074c1f94fe",
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "Use label or labelColor for primary information",
      "section_path": [
        "Labels",
        "Best practices"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "8ef8ae71525c41ef904c6c0928efa451856f7f206b962b9682d2428a617bd2d9",
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Use secondaryLabel or secondaryLabelColor for subheadings or supplemental text",
      "section_path": [
        "Labels",
        "Best practices"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "f83b760b39663fda7402eed142d411983934e1bf5041171b603c535720b6f86f",
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Use tertiaryLabel or tertiaryLabelColor for unavailable items or behaviors",
      "section_path": [
        "Labels",
        "Best practices"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "7e6ae68216778953640099c3dc379ccd81ba4c8950cd567ad867dab37f4de63e",
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Use quaternaryLabel or quaternaryLabelColor for watermark text",
      "section_path": [
        "Labels",
        "Best practices"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "03751409819b69a6b891ef0b800dd4979eb947e1451e62497bbf39dd1eae459b",
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Make useful label text selectable",
      "section_path": [
        "Labels",
        "Best practices"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "b69a95a6300b347b55cf840b6f3f54f38a1f2b533b565527c342ae4fd78e0343",
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Consider using date and timer components in complications",
      "section_path": [
        "Labels",
        "Platform considerations",
        "watchOS"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "8aa6e16a1eb6df6d74106c483dc9849fc92f80fc55d109c40e8c277f41868ef5",
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
